# Good Day Sunshine, refrain, last two bars (figure 11.2)
# Same 3 + 3 + 2 accents as fig. 11.1, now over E7; "I take a..." is the verse's pickup on beat 4.
#? "Day" and "shine" are typed a little after beats 2 and 1; they are placed on the beat.
key A

system
words "Beats"     | 1 2 3 4 | 1 2 3 4 |
words "Accents"   | >*3 > | r*2 >*2 |
# lyrics as typed by Pollack are omitted here; x marks each sung syllable
words "Sung rhythm" | x x*2 x | x*3 x |
chords "Chords"   | E7{V} | - |
